    "hub_repo": "afghanistan-development-initiative.github.io",
    "rule": "Keep public pages, shared schemas, source registry, and lightweight prototypes in this hub. Give each serious dashboard or application its own repository when it has separate code, data processing, deployment, or maintenance needs.",
